CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-1-json-batch-key-order-rejected.md=HEADING:1. content-first key order (valid JSON\, RFC 8259 objects are unordered)
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-1-json-batch-key-order-rejected.md=HEADING:EXPECTED: Compiled 3 CU(s)\, exit 0
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-1-json-batch-key-order-rejected.md=HEADING:ACTUAL: IllegalStateException: Missing required parts: ArchCU\, LegendCU\, exit 1
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-1-json-batch-key-order-rejected.md=HEADING:2. same values\, cu-id-first order
CODEX..LLMDD/spec-driven/bugs/bug-1-json-batch-key-order-rejected.md=HEADING:EXPECTED and ACTUAL: Compiled 3 CU(s)\, exit 0
