CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:When to use
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:Prerequisites
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:Procedure (stop on first red gate)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:1. Commit pending specs
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:2. Build DTR (`build-dtr`)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:3. Draft the batch CU (dummy-proof)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:4. Compile ITR (`compile-itr`)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:5. Create waves (`run-waves` planning)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:6. Dry-run the waves and fix until green
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:7. Write the wave command file
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:8. Print the wave command
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:9. Commit
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:Rules
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/prepare-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:Verify
