CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:Procedure (stop on first red gate)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:1. Confirm the run finished
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:2. Review the implementation diff
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:3. Review wave logs and feedback
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:4. Compare implementation to requirements
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:5. Re-run acceptance tests independently
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:6. Close the specs (only on full green)
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:7. Commit
CODEX..LLMDD/skills/review-implementation/SKILL.md=HEADING:8. Book summary (llmdd-book — mandatory)
